on Industry (Improving Productivity) Bill 2013 [No. 2] and Building and Construction Industry (Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Bill 2013 [No. 2]\". Stephen Parry The question is that the motion moved by Senator Muir be agreed to.","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-4142","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2016-03-16/3"}
